    "summary": "Sowei mask. Carved wooden helmet mask in the form of a human face, stained black. Small facial features, protruding ears, pronounced forehead and four parallel scarification marks beneath each eye. Elaborate five-ridged hairstyle and side panels carved with geometric patterns. On left proper side of head eight-pronged comb carved in low relief. At back representation of two spherical gourds ? connected at top with small bone-like object. Three deep neck rings with small holes around base of mask for attachment of black-dyed raffia fringe.",
